<title>UK: Williams Hldngs posts Chubb offer.</title>
<headline>Williams Hldngs posts Chubb offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British security group Williams Holdings Plc said on Friday that it had posted the document covering particulars of its recommended offer for Chubb Security Plc.</p>
<p>The offer valued each Chubb ordinary share at 441.33 pence, and its total share capital at 1.3 billion pounds. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
